<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIA LISTED AZOMURES POSTS HIGHER 1996 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>ROMANIA LISTED AZOMURES POSTS HIGHER 1996 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>					  (billion of lei unless stated)</p>
<p> Gross profit			   125.94     vs    38.42</p>
<p> Net profit				72.63     vs    14.18</p>
<p> Turnover				 574.00     vs   333.38</p>
<p> Fixed assets			   203.43     vs   162.35</p>
<p> Working capital			205.82     vs   101.95</p>
<p> Total assets			   425.47     vs   271.60</p>
<p> Share capital			  209.46     vs   168.54</p>
<p> Total debts			    129.01     vs    60.06</p>
<p> Total dividends			 26.48     vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Dividend per share - net	   113.78 lei vs    n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE -- Azomures is a fertiliser maker listed on the Bucharest stock exchange's first tier. Data, reported to the bourse, are in nominal terms and in line with Romanian accounting standards. ($=7,089 lei)</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
